Z||000000||Motorhead||03-18-2000||09:57 PM||||Just did one of those 40 mile runs from my place to my Lady's place. Following her Accord, passing on the straights, leaving her in the curves, toying with the asian iron.  God, I love this little car! <P>OK!  Mario she ain't, but I've owned Triumphs, MG's, Sunbeams, Alfa, and Fiat.<P>All supposedly state of the art for thier time, but I'm on my second Fiero, and the little American is still my favorite.<P>Just haven't found anything that feels the same!<P>Kinda' like an old friend.<P>Ain't life grand?  Still!||||reg||1
